Develop a dashboard prototype in Figma displaying performance criteria for a
cellular system.
Aim: To develop a dashboard prototype displaying the performance criteria of a cellular system using Figma.
Procedure:
1. Create a dashboard frame in Figma.
2. Add cards for signal strength, network speed, latency, and call success rate.
3. Include graphs and charts to display performance.
4. Add status indicators using different colors.
5. Arrange the elements clearly for easy monitoring.
Output Design: A dashboard showing cellular network performance metrics, graphs, and status indicators.

Result: A cellular system performance dashboard prototype was created successfully using Figma.
